--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PREAMBLE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This project represents a joint effort between human oversight and machine
synthesis. The system design, software architecture, prompts, and sanity checks
were curated and reviewed by a human architect ("The Architect"), while the bulk
syntax, boilerplate, and code tokens were generated by Artificial Intelligence.

In short: Hand-crafted prompts, human architectural supervision, and machine-
minted artisanal slop.

